{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53978","headline":"偈 十二 · 景岑","name":"偈 十二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"佛性堂堂显现，住性有情难见。\n若悟衆生无我，我面何殊（《五灯会元》作「如」）佛面？\n（《景德传灯录》卷十、《五灯会元》卷四）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"景岑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53978.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53978","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}